{"id":"64279ecae5246baf","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-computable-function.md","title":"Computable Function","display":"df-computable-function — Computable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-computable-function","aliases":["88-df-computable-function"],"display":"df-computable-function — Computable Function","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-defined]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-computable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-function — Computable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate partial number-theoretic function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{x} \\in \\mathbb{N}^k\">\\(\\vec{x} \\in \\mathbb{N}^k\\)</span> (input vector, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (computability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed computability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})\">\\(\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})\\)</span> (defined-at predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec{x}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec{x}))\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec{x}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec{x}))\\)</span> (output function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\">\\(\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\\)</span> (binary word coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件起即使用本册数值函数接口的一元搬运约定：沿规范双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto\\langle x\\rangle\">\\(x\\mapsto\\langle x\\rangle\\)</span> 识别输入空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^1\">\\(\\mathbb N^1\\)</span>，并相应地识别函数图中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\)</span>；比较或应用图以前使用同一表示。该约定也适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^1,\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^1,\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 的数值一元实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上述搬运不删除编码中的单元组层：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\)</span> 仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle x\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle x\\rangle)\\)</span> 的缩写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}\\)</span> 保留原来的元组长度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{wordenc}[\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}]\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\to\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Output}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n=\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle f(\\vec x)\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{wordenc}[\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}]\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\to\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Output}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n=\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle f(\\vec x)\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是可计算函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M\\)</span> : Turing 机停机 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M\\)</span> : Turing 机输出 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}\\)</span> 的值是二进制输入词；自然数值编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 不再被错误地当作字符串。</li>\n<li>停机当且仅当输入属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>的定义域；输出只采用单元素元组的标准编码，\n不再同时要求两个可能不同的输出表示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-4","tar